{"id":"9c7800e368cc2b25","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-logic9-categoricity-spectrum.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Categoricity Spectrum","display":"df-zfc-logic9-categoricity-spectrum — ZFC Logic9 Categoricity Spectrum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-categoricity-spectrum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-categoricity-spectrum"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-categoricity-spectrum — ZFC Logic9 Categoricity Spectrum","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-logic]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-categoricity-spectrum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-categoricity-spectrum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-categoricity-spectrum — ZFC Logic9 Categoricity Spectrum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"58-df-logic\">58-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"01f4b76e2e096590\" href=\"?note=01f4b76e2e096590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md\">../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (common first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal K\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded family of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in V\">\\(S\\in V\\)</span> (categoricity spectrum set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure predicate and universe operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_S\\)</span> (isomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"01f4b76e2e096590\" href=\"?note=01f4b76e2e096590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md\">../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9CategoricitySpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9CategoricitySpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}categoricity\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9CategoricitySpectrum}_S(S,\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\Bigl(\\forall M\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr)\\land S=\\Bigl\\{\\lambda\\in\\{|\\mathrm{Univ}(M)|:M\\in\\mathcal K\\}:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\forall M,N\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\bigl((|\\mathrm{Univ}(M)|=\\lambda\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(N)|=\\lambda)\\to\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,M,N,\\mathcal L)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}categoricity\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9CategoricitySpectrum}_S(S,\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\Bigl(\\forall M\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr)\\land S=\\Bigl\\{\\lambda\\in\\{|\\mathrm{Univ}(M)|:M\\in\\mathcal K\\}:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\forall M,N\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\bigl((|\\mathrm{Univ}(M)|=\\lambda\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(N)|=\\lambda)\\to\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,M,N,\\mathcal L)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> is set-coded, and the spectrum is separated from the replacement image <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{|\\mathrm{Univ}(M)|:M\\in\\mathcal K\\}\">\\(\\{|\\mathrm{Univ}(M)|:M\\in\\mathcal K\\}\\)</span> rather than formed by unbounded comprehension over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Categoricity at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> includes existence of a member of size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> and uniqueness up to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-isomorphism.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"01f4b76e2e096590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal K\\in V$ (set-coded family of $\\mathcal L$-structures, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"01f4b76e2e096590","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_S$ (isomorphism predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","disp